# Dependency trees and build output — regenerated locally, never to be tracked.
# `functions/node_modules/` is the npm install tree for the Cloud Functions package and
# `functions/lib/` is the compiled output of `npm run build` (`main: lib/index.js`).
# Ignoring them keeps `git status` to the real source changes instead of thousands of
# dependency files. No file is deleted by these rules.
node_modules/
functions/lib/